  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">African Orphanage Research</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The funding will support the delivery of a multi-country research and policy initiative to establish the first regional evidence base on orphanage trafficking in Africa, and to strengthen prevention, protection, and prosecution responses within child protection and care reform systems. Specifically, the funding aims to: generate robust, comparative evidence on how orphanage trafficking operates across five African countries and how it drives unnecessary family separation and child institutionalisation.</narrative>
  </description>
